{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14103210","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14103210","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1410321001:0":{"text":"祖娅与深岩村的那些矮人果然认识。我们才决定相信她，没想到……","source_cn":"祖娅与深岩村的那些矮人果然认识。我们才决定相信她，没想到……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E688FC8CB0D7B6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1410321002:1":{"text":"虽然认识，但祖娅似乎已经离开那里很久了。","source_cn":"虽然认识，但祖娅似乎已经离开那里很久了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38845D0E9CE82C1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410321003:1":{"text":"如果深岩村的真正目的是建造神殿复活赫托，听起来，祖娅似乎是反对这么做才离开的。","source_cn":"如果深岩村的真正目的是建造神殿复活赫托，听起来，祖娅似...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA86C2AD0E544E65F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410321004:1":{"text":"不管是提到建神殿，还是提到复活神明，祖娅都表现出了嗤之以鼻的态度。","source_cn":"不管是提到建神殿，还是提到复活神明，祖娅都表现出了嗤之...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3AF42C932BDACD1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410321005:1":{"text":"你的意思是，我们还是应该相信祖娅？","source_cn":"你的意思是，我们还是应该相信祖娅？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C0C8E148A88580C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":